{"speciesId":461,"names":{"fr":"Dimoret","es":"Weavile","en":"Weavile","ja":"マニューラ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"They live in cold regions, forming groups of four or five that hunt prey with impressive coordination."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It sends signals to others by carving odd patterns in frost- covered trees and ice."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Evolution made it even more devious. It communicates by clawing signs in boulders."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It lives in snowy regions. It carves patterns in trees with its claws as a signal to others."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It lives in snowy regions. It carves patterns in trees with its claws as a signal to others."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"L’évolution l’a rendu encore plus retors. Il communique en griffant des signes dans les pierres."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Evolution made it even more devious. It communicates by clawing signs in boulders."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"L’évolution l’a rendu encore plus retors. Il communique en griffant des signes dans les pierres."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Evolution made it even more devious. It communicates by clawing signs in boulders."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"They communicate by clawing signs in boulders and work together to surround enemies."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"They communicate by clawing signs in boulders and work together to surround enemies."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il vit dans les régions enneigées, et communique avec ses pairs en gravant des motifs sur les arbres."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Vive en zonas nevadas. Deja marcas en los árboles con sus garras para comunicarse con sus compañeros."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It lives in snowy regions. It carves patterns in trees with its claws as a signal to others."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"雪の 多い 地方に 生息。 樹木に ツメで サインを 描き 仲間に 合図を 送る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Ils vivent par groupe de 4 ou 5 en région froide et chassent de façon très organisée."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Viven en zonas frías y forman grupos de cuatro o cinco para cazar con gran coordinación."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"They live in cold regions, forming groups of four or five that hunt prey with impressive coordination."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"寒い 地域で 暮らす ポケモン。 ４、５匹の グループは 見事な 連係で 獲物を 追いつめる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il vit dans les régions enneigées, et communique avec ses pairs en gravant des motifs sur les arbres."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Vive en zonas nevadas. Deja marcas en los árboles con sus garras para comunicarse con sus compañeros."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"It lives in snowy regions. It carves patterns in trees with its claws as a signal to others."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"雪の 多い 地方に 生息。 樹木に ツメで サインを 描き 仲間に 合図を 送る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Ils vivent par groupe de quatre ou cinq en région froide et chassent de façon très organisée."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Viven en zonas frías y forman grupos de cuatro o cinco para cazar con gran coordinación."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"They live in cold regions, forming groups of four or five that hunt prey with impressive coordination."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"寒い 地域で 暮らす ポケモン。 ４、５匹の グループは 見事な 連係で 獲物を 追いつめる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Il se déplace en groupe de quatre ou cinq. Lors de la chasse, il laisse des signes sur les arbres ou les rochers pour communiquer efficacement."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Siempre van en grupos de cuatro o cinco. Dejan marcas en rocas y árboles al cazar para coordinarse con sus compañeros."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"They travel in groups of four or five, leaving signs for one another on trees and rocks. They bring down their prey with coordinated attacks."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"４～５匹の グループで 行動。 岩や 樹木に サインを 残し 連係プレイで 獲物を 仕留める。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Habitant des régions enneigées, il ne se nourrit que de Goupix et de Sabelette à Alola. Il partage toujours ses proies avec ses amis."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Habita en lugares fríos. En Alola se alimenta principalmente de Vulpix y Sandshrew, presas que reparte entre sus congéneres."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"They dwell in cold places. This Pokémon’s main food source in Alola is Vulpix and Sandshrew, which they carefully divide among their group."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"寒い 場所に 棲み アローラでは ロコンや サンドが 主な 餌。 獲物は 仲間で きちんと 分ける。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il chasse les Sabelette en équipe : un Dimoret maintient la proie sur le dos, puis un deuxième l’achève d’un coup de griffe."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Trabaja en parejas. Uno pone la zancadilla a un Sandshrew y, cuando está boca arriba, el otro Weavile lo ataca con sus afiladas garras."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"One Weavile will trip a Sandshrew and flip it over, and then another Weavile will deal the finishing blow with its sharp claws."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"１匹が サンドの 足を すくい ひっくり返すと もう １匹が 鋭いツメで 止めを 刺す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il est devenu assez sournois pour ne plus avoir à se battre pour ses proies. Quiconque entre en contact avec ses griffes souffrira de gelures."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Se ha vuelto tan astuto que las disputas por las presas obtenidas son cosa del pasado. Quien se ve golpeado por sus garras sufre congelaciones."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Thanks to its increased intelligence, scrapping over food is a thing of the past. A scratch from its claws will give you a case of frostbite!"},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"賢くなり エサを 巡っての ケンカは 起こらなくなった。 ツメで ひっかかれると 凍傷になるぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Ils chassent en hordes. Grâce à leur bonne coordination, ils peuvent aisément venir à bout de grands Pokémon comme Mammochon."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Cazan en grupo, lo que les permite abatir con facilidad presas de gran tamaño, como los Mamoswine."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"They attack their quarry in packs. Prey as large as Mamoswine easily fall to the teamwork of a group of Weavile."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"群れを 成し 獲物を 襲う。 チームプレーで マンムーなどの 大物も たやすく しとめる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il communique avec ses semblables en gravant des motifs avec ses griffes. Il existerait près de 500 signes différents."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Se comunican mediante marcas que tallan con sus garras. Se cree que tienen un repertorio de más de 500."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"With its claws, it leaves behind signs for its friends to find. The number of distinct signs is said to be over 500."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"ツメで サインを 描き 仲間と 連絡。 サインの 種類は ５００以上 あると いう。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"This species corners prey as a pack, under the guidance of a leader. Weavile displays increased cunning, leading me to speculate that its evolution caused further brain development."}],"varieties":[{"id":461,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"scratch","learns":[[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[1